    "rationale": "Independent review of the exact V2 subject confirms that the two historical UI defects are corrected in source: missionId is validated and resolved through the existing inspection/merge path, and retained neutral or success rationale is no longer labeled Waiting. Those corrections do not make the candidate acceptable. A fresh run of the repository pinned blocking command, pnpm audit:static --base-ref 01dabaa83ce3912c89f639b352aa1fc91531741d, exits 1 on this exact commit with introduced critical complexity in CoordinationPanel and introduced high complexity in CandidateIdentity. The CI workflow runs this audit as a mandatory gate before typecheck, tests, and build, and the mission plan expressly requires canonical checks to pass with no integration regression. Thus the passing typecheck, focused tests, and owner-reported 443 tests/build cannot resolve the failed required gate. Both exact-subject N3 opinions identify this same blocking defect, with no unresolved questions. Changes are required to accept any candidate, but the mission sole correction has already been consumed; this verdict rejects the current subject and does not authorize a second correction.",
